TMD-DEBUG instrumentation for termux mesa 26.2.6 (Turnip/kgsl + X11 WSI).
Not for upstream. Everything is inactive unless TMD_DEBUG=1 (logging) or
TMD_FORCE_FENCE_WAIT=1 (diagnostic: CPU-wait for the render fence before
PresentPixmap in every present mode). Log lines start with "TMD " and go to
stderr and, if set, to the file named by TMD_LOG.

Logged:
 - result of wsi_drm_check_dma_buf_sync_file_import_export() with the failing
   step and errno
 - per swapchain: explicit sync / self-test / dma_buf_semaphore creation, and
   the X11 parameters (DRI3 modifiers, same_gpu, xwayland, fence wait)
 - per present (first 20, then every 300th): image path, dma_buf_fd, whether
   a SYNC_FD was exported from the semaphore and its fence state, the
   DMA_BUF_IOCTL_IMPORT_SYNC_FILE result, and the dma-buf's fence state right
   after the import
 - kgsl IOCTL_KGSL_TIMESTAMP_EVENT failures (silently mapped to fd -1 upstream)

